No fix plans generated — none of the four match the Phase 6 allowlist (sync-to-async / type-coercion / missing-batch-tool), which each entry records. TOOL-037 is the most mechanical of them (two additions and a deletion) if you want it hand-carried rather than waiting on the dispatch step.

