- **[BUG-040] needs reframing.** The label was authored directly on `SF Pro / Semibold`; `loadFontAsync` resolved, `fontName` read back correctly, and it still measured `w: 0`. The font was not missing. The VM's font dump also shows exactly five families offering a one-word `Semibold` — precisely the five session 56 tested, four of which are broken — which explains why `SF Pro` keeps getting picked and keeps failing.

